### 1. Check all transactions
GET http://localhost:8080/SpendWise/api/transactions

### 2. Add a test transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/SpendWise/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "College expenses",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "category": "Education",
  "transaction_date": "2026-10-16"
}

